  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/docs1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: f and g each with local inner calling helper now give inner(4)->helper and inner(8)->helper - caller crediting is by position and seen_names is gone (907d2f25d3, 2026-10-12), so 'first definition wins / replaces f->helper' no longer reproduces; local value lets make no symbol. Still wrong: f -> inner(8-8), i.e. f's call to its own local inner binds to g's inner by name. MECHANISM: callee looked up by name in a file-wide table ignoring lexical scope of local bindings. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gilur,WI-sisuv,WI-tosum."  # 2c90
